# Companion RiC-O 1.1 vocabulary stub.
#
# The official RiC-O OWL file (107 classes, 75 datatype properties, 480 object
# properties) is too large to bundle here. This stub declares all 107 RiC-O 1.1
# classes (so the class picker in the entity editor is genuinely complete) plus a
# curated set of the most commonly used object and datatype properties (so the
# property picker has useful suggestions). It is NOT a complete re-publication of
# RiC-O -- no domains, ranges, hierarchies or full documentation are asserted, only
# rdf:type + rdfs:label, which is all the entity editor needs to enumerate options.
# Properties outside this curated set can still be used via free-text entry in the
# editor; this file only affects what appears as a suggestion.
#
# Source: RiC-O 1.1 (https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology), May 2025.

@prefix owl:  <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix rico: <https://www.ica.org/standards/RiC/ontology#> .

